---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Usage on this site — Virtual DDD"
  description="How Virtual DDD uses — and doesn't use — AI across our recordings, stories, heuristics and design."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--pink">Transparency</p>
    <h1>AI Usage on this site</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-muted">
      <p>
        We are a community-driven platform for people who want to get more in-depth knowledge of systems
        and software design for solving complex business problems. As such, the recorded video content on
        this website is <strong>not generated by AI</strong>. Additionally, all web and brand design is
        done by <a href="https://artofdesign.nl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Art of Design</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, since we invite guest speakers to give talks, we cannot confirm whether the content they
        show in their videos or the text provided in their abstracts is AI-generated. Furthermore, because
        we are a community-based platform, some of the feature images may be AI-generated — such as the
        ones for our heuristics and the background templates for our stories, which are based on our
        current branding. We are, however, committed to using <em>Canva</em> as much as possible and are
        working to replace these images step-by-step.
      </p>
      <p>
        All of our stories on facilitating software architecture and design are <em>original content</em>,
        recorded and edited with <em>Descript</em>, which uses AI features. The blog posts and heuristics
        that follow these stories are first generated from the transcript via AI and then fully edited and
        refined by us.
      </p>
      <p>
        Lastly, all the original content we write ourselves is spell-checked and improved using tools like
        Grammarly and different kinds of personal LLMs from time to time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .page { max-width: 48rem; padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-16); }
    .page h1 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-8); }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
